Use LLVM 23 with its matching clang-scan-deps, CMake 4.4 or newer, and Ninja
1.12 or newer. The CMake configure step checks C++26 structured-binding packs
and Clang properties with explicit object parameters; a version number alone
is not a compatibility guarantee. Windows uses clang-cl and a configured MSVC
SDK environment. On macOS use LLVM Clang rather than the system Apple Clang.

The maintained configure, build, test and installed-package commands are in
<a href="building.md">Building and consuming native</a>. CMake owns the build;
GNUmakefile is an optional wrapper around the current presets.

Documentation is optional: enable NATIVE_BUILD_DOCS and build native_docs with
Doxygen 1.18 or newer and Graphviz. Neither tool is required for the library.
*/
